{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27531","headline":"题陆敦礼山居伏牛潭 · 张祜","name":"题陆敦礼山居伏牛潭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伏牛真怪事，余胜几人谙。\n日彩沉青壁，烟容静碧潭。\n泛心何虑冷，漱齿讵忘甘。\n幸挈壶中物，期君正兴酣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27531.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27531","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}